==Russian==

===Prefix===
'''про-''' (pro-)

# {{cx|used with verbs|lang=ru}} [[through]], [[past]] {{gloss|describing an action of passing through a space or an object; unstressed}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[идти́]]|''(impf., concrete)'' to go|inline=y}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[пройти́]]|''(pf.)'' to go through, to pass by|inline=y}}
# {{cx|used with verbs|lang=ru}} {{gloss|describing an action of covering a whole object; unstressed}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[са́лить]]|''(impf)'' to grease, apply oil onto something|inline=y}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[проса́лить]]|''(pf.)'' to cover something with oil completely|inline=y}}
# {{cx|used with verbs|lang=ru}} {{gloss|describing an action of passing by an entity and moving further from an entity; unstressed}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[пусти́ть]]|''(pf)'' to let|inline=y}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[пропусти́ть]]|''(pf.)'' to let pass through|inline=y}}
# {{cx|used with verbs|lang=ru}} {{gloss|describing an action that entails completeness, exhaustiveness, or accuracy; unstressed}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[штуди́ровать]]|''(impf)'' to study (in a form of researching)|inline=y}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[проштуди́ровать]]|''(pf.)'' to study throughly|inline=y}}
# {{cx|used with verbs|lang=ru}} {{gloss|describing a momentary action with a short duration; unstressed}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[визжа́ть]]|''(impf)'' to squeal|inline=y}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[провизжа́ть]]|''(pf.)'' to squeal (momentarily for a short time)|inline=y}}
# {{cx|used with verbs|lang=ru}} {{gloss|describing an action that lasts for a certain period of time; unstressed}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[ждать]]|''(impf)'' to wait|inline=y}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[прожда́ть]]|''(pf.)'' to wait (for a certain period of time)|inline=y}}
# {{cx|used with verbs|lang=ru}} {{gloss|describing an action that describes losses, expenses, wasting, or forgetting; unstressed}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[просро́чить]]|''(pf.)'' to expire (time-wise, as time for doing something is lost)|inline=y}}

===Prefix===
'''про-''' (pro-)

# {{cx|used with nouns|lang=ru}} {{gloss|describing a state of being that is located between two entities or among more than two entities}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[промежу́ток]]|interval|inline=y}}
# {{cx|used with adjectives or nouns|lang=ru}} {{gloss|describing an initial appearance or insufficiency of characteristics}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[про́зелень]]|greenness|inline=y}}

===Prefix===
'''про-''' (pro-)

# [[pro-]]
# {{cx|used with nouns|lang=ru}} {{gloss|describing an replacement of something}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[проре́ктор]]|deputy rector|inline=y}}
# {{cx|used with adjectives or nouns|lang=ru}} [[forth]] or [[before]]; same as in Latin [[pro-]]
#:* {{ux|ru|[[прогре́сс]]|progress|inline=y}}

